{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YIsPkF6zaH1794835416.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共總書記、國家主席習近平到了廣東中山考察，強調要奮力開創粵港澳大灣區高質量發展新局面。他又到訪孫中山故居紀念館。</p><p></p><p>中共總書記習近平這日先到訪深中通道西人工島，了解通道建設運營情況，指出要建設粵港澳大灣區，首先要推進交通一體化，要讓深中通道更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。他之後到訪翠亨新區的灣區未來科技城，他強調建設粵港澳大灣區是中共中央作出的重大戰略部署，希望中山抓住機遇，推動高質量發展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-16-21h17m55s645.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nEo2sXXmnx1794835238.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今年是孫中山先生誕辰160周年，習近平前往南朗街道的孫中山故居紀念館，向孫中山銅像敬獻花籃，又參觀展覽，察看故居保護情況。</p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-16-21h18m28s438.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264NPJF7a4Wz1794835205.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-16-21h18m25s478.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u3rvNz8mwA1794835260.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>習近平指，要深入研究孫中山先生的生平和思想，講好孫中山先生的革命故事，教育引導幹部群眾，特別是青少年學習偉人風範、矢志愛國報國。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-16-21h18m44s758.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026M3orERn9ZB1794835282.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他又強調，做好歲末年初各項工作，推動經濟持續向新向優向好，實現「十五五」良好開局。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-16-21h19m03s342.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oXtJP5J2aV1794835296.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:10.163506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T21:57:19.367343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:22.611696+00:00","content_hash":"9629826caf398fbed4ed479df6592c1e14215ce64a03ab61c60a6fc6b2f11d04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}